**Critical Note on RNA Velocity Requirements**

For scVelo dynamical mode (our RNA velocity engine), we need raw BAM
files or loom files containing UNSPLICED and SPLICED read counts per
gene per cell. Standard processed count matrices are insufficient. We
must verify that each scRNA-seq dataset was generated with a protocol
that captures intronic reads (10X Chromium does this by default).
Datasets from Smart-seq2 or other plate-based methods may lack
sufficient unspliced reads for reliable velocity estimation.

